# Exemplos de todos os endpoints. Funciona no VS Code (REST Client) e no IntelliJ.
# Ordem sugerida: health -> criar -> login -> admin. Copie os valores devolvidos
# para as variaveis abaixo (id, token, accessToken, fileId).

@api = http://localhost:3001/api
@id = cole-o-id-aqui
@token = cole-o-token-aqui
@accessToken = cole-o-accessToken-aqui
@fileId = cole-o-fileId-aqui

### Health: API e Mongo
GET {{api}}/health

### Criar solicitacao com 2 arquivos (201: id, token, status)
POST {{api}}/public/requests
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Construtora Exemplo Ltda
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

contato@exemplo.com
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phone"

(11) 98765-4321
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Preciso de 40 escoras metalicas por 30 dias para a obra X.
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="contrato.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/contrato.pdf
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="foto.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/foto.png
--FormBoundary--

### Criar com executavel renomeado para .pdf (415: o tipo vem do conteudo)
POST {{api}}/public/requests
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Teste Tipo Invalido
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

teste@exemplo.com
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phone"

11987654321
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Arquivo com extensao de PDF e conteudo de executavel.
--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="nota.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/executavel-renomeado.pdf
--FormBoundary--

### Consultar status (token no header, nunca na URL)
GET {{api}}/public/requests/{{id}}/status
X-Consultation-Token: {{token}}

### Consultar com token errado (404 igual ao de id inexistente)
GET {{api}}/public/requests/{{id}}/status
X-Consultation-Token: token-errado

### Login do admin (200: accessToken, expiresIn)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@escoramento.local", "password": "sua-senha" }

### Listar (paginado, filtro opcional por status)
GET {{api}}/admin/requests?page=1&limit=10&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Detalhe com os arquivos (pegue o fileId daqui)
GET {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Editar dados (status e files no corpo dao 400)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Preciso de 50 escoras por 45 dias." }

### Mudar status (PENDING -> UNDER_REVIEW -> APPROVED | CANCELLED)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "UNDER_REVIEW" }

### Adicionar arquivos (201; 409 se passar de 5)
POST {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}/files
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="foto.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/foto.png
--FormBoundary--

### Substituir arquivo (campo `file`, mantem o fileId)
PUT {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contrato.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/contrato.pdf
--FormBoundary--

### URL assinada de download (5 minutos)
GET {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}/files/{{fileId}}/url
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### URL assinada para visualizar (inline, usada no preview do admin)
GET {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}/files/{{fileId}}/url?disposition=inline
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Remover arquivo (204)
DELETE {{api}}/admin/requests/{{id}}/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
